    67→impl DASContext {
    68→    /// Given a collection of commitments, cells and proofs, this functions verifies that
    69→    /// the cells are consistent with the commitments using their respective KZG proofs.
    70→    ///
    71→    /// The matching function in the specs is: https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/13ac373a2c284dc66b48ddd2ef0a10537e4e0de6/specs/_features/eip7594/polynomial-commitments-sampling.md#verify_cell_kzg_proof_batch
